1
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:39,333
Mama Jack is a comedy film directed by Gray Hofmeyr.

2
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:12,666
Set in Cape Town, South Africa Mama Jack is the story of Jack
Theron, an ordinary person working on a film set.

3
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
However, his movie producer boss hates him and wants to
remove him from the production of the film.

4
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
In a bid to get rid of Jack, the producer spikes his drink with a drug at a glamorous
function, and before long Jack has got himself on the wrong side of the law.

5
00:27:46,666 --> 00:27:52,666
While on the run, Jack turns to his friend, a make-up
artist, who turns him into "Mama Bolo".

6
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
Mama Bolo soon finds “herself” employed by the producer’s fiancée, Angela.

7
00:38:53,333 --> 00:38:59,333
A series of deceptions and misunderstandings pile up and comic mayhem ensues with Jack
Theron becoming another character, Doctor Donald, a tramp from Scotland.

8
00:44:26,666 --> 00:44:32,666
Jack Theron, Donald And Mama Bola, played by Leon Schuster.

9
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Angela, played by Mary-Ann Barlow.

10
00:55:33,333 --> 00:55:39,333
John D. Daragon, played by Lionel Newton.

11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
Stanley, played by Jerry Mofokeng.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Shorty Dladla, played by Alfred Ntombela.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
Mayoress, played by Shaleen Surtie-Richards.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
Mama Jack is a 2005 South African comedy film by Leon Schuster.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
It was directed by Gray Hofmeyr and distributed by Nu Metro.

16
01:28:53,333 --> 01:28:59,333
It is one of Leon Schuster's most successful films.

17
01:34:26,666 --> 01:34:32,666
The tone is lighthearted.
